     "body": "<p>Note: Git does not support empty directories, and prior to the migration, the build depended on a couple of them.  These have been fixed in maintenance-3.4 and master.  For example:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/commit/d6f8a8baad7116f003277a8d132cc95475ca897d\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/commit/d6f8a8baad7116f003277a8d132cc95475ca897d</a></p>\n",
     "created": "18/Jan/11 1:03 PM",
     "id": "11771",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10781/comment/11771",
     "updateAuthor": {
