      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Note: The maven-buildnumber-plugin does not support git.  It has been disabled in our builds as part of the migration, in maintenance-3.4 and master:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/commit/58fb71d649ae764c44e4517c22994df7bfcca938\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/commit/58fb71d649ae764c44e4517c22994df7bfcca938</a></p>",
     "created": "18/Jan/11 1:05 PM",
     "id": "11772",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10781/comment/11772",
